{"id":45540,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/45540/itaewon-class","name":"Itaewon Class","type":"Scripted","language":"Korean","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Ended","runtime":80,"averageRuntime":80,"premiered":"2020-01-31","ended":"2020-03-21","officialSite":"http://tv.jtbc.joins.com/itaewonclass","schedule":{"time":"22:50","days":["Friday","Saturday"]},"rating":{"average":7.7},"weight":81,"network":{"id":268,"name":"jTBC","country":{"name":"Korea, Republic of","code":"KR","timezone":"Asia/Seoul"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":373411,"imdb":"tt11239552"},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/236/591651.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/236/591651.jpg"},"summary":"<p><b>Itaewon Class</b> tells the story of Park Sae Roy who is uncompromising in the face of injustice as he goes up against the food industry conglomerate in Itaewon. Meanwhile, Jo Yi Seo is a highly intelligent sociopath with the face of an angel but a completely different personality. Finally, Oh Soo Ah is an honest and confident woman who was Park Sae Roy's first love and is now an employee of a rival company.</p>","updated":1759840708,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796792","name":"Episode 16"}},"_embedded":{"episodes":[{"id":1779934,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1779934/itaewon-class-1x01-episode-1","name":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-01-31","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-01-31T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":8.3},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/242/607004.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/242/607004.jpg"},"summary":"<p>On his first day at a new high school, Park Sae Royi stands by his principles in front of powerful bullies. Oh Soo Ah works on getting into college. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1779934"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1779935,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1779935/itaewon-class-1x02-episode-2","name":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-01","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-01T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":9},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/242/607005.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/242/607005.jpg"},"summary":"<p>While serving his time, Sae Royi develops a bold game plan for his future. Soo Ah can't ignore a generous offer from Jang Dae Hee. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1779935"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1779936,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1779936/itaewon-class-1x03-episode-3","name":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-07","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-07T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":9},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/242/607006.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/242/607006.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Sae Royi crosses paths with Jo Yi Seo, who seems to have a knack for bringing him trouble. Meanwhile Dan Bam struggles to attract customers. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1779936"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1779937,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1779937/itaewon-class-1x04-episode-4","name":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-08","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-08T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":9.3},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/242/607007.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/242/607007.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Choi Seung Kwon regrets reverting back to his old ways. When Yi Seo's night out takes an ugly turn, Sae Royi is there to help. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1779937"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796781,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796781/itaewon-class-1x05-episode-5","name":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-14","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-14T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":9.5},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/242/607008.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/242/607008.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Before its reopening, Dan Bam gets a few upgrades. Yi Seo, Seung Kwon and Jan Geun Soo have a surprise encounter at a nightclub.</p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796781"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796782,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796782/itaewon-class-1x06-episode-6","name":"Episode 6","season":1,"number":6,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-15","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-15T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":9.3},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/242/607009.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/242/607009.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Dae Hee keeps tabs on Dan Bam's progress. Sae Royi runs into Jang Geun Won at the TV station. Yi Seo faces her mother's disappointment. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796782"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796783,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796783/itaewon-class-1x07-episode-7","name":"Episode 7","season":1,"number":7,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-21","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-21T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":9.3},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/247/617763.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/247/617763.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Dan Bam gets an unwelcome visitor. Sae Royi approaches Kang Min Jung with a weighty proposition, and shares his entire story with Yi Seo. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796783"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796784,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796784/itaewon-class-1x08-episode-8","name":"Episode 8","season":1,"number":8,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-22","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-22T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":9.3},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/247/617764.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/247/617764.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Bad news strikes Dan Bam, but Sae Royi isn't one to bow under pressure. Geun Soo learns a horrible truth. Kim Toni deals with discrimination.</p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796784"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796785,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796785/itaewon-class-1x09-episode-9","name":"Episode 9","season":1,"number":9,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-28","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-28T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":6.5},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/247/617765.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/247/617765.jpg"},"summary":"<p> The bar's move to a quieter street poses fresh problems for the crew. Dae Hee takes an interest in Sae Royi's people. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796785"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796786,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796786/itaewon-class-1x10-episode-10","name":"Episode 10","season":1,"number":10,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-02-29","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-02-29T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":8.3},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/247/617766.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/247/617766.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Jang Ga finds itself in hot water with the public. With the future of the company hanging in the balance, Dae Hee must make his choice.</p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796786"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796787,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796787/itaewon-class-1x11-episode-11","name":"Episode 11","season":1,"number":11,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-03-06","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-03-06T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":6},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/247/617767.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/247/617767.jpg"},"summary":"<p>After Ma Hyun Yi makes a buzzy TV appearance, a big opportunity comes knocking for Dan Bam. Geun Soo goes after what he wants. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796787"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796788,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796788/itaewon-class-1x12-episode-12","name":"Episode 12","season":1,"number":12,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-03-07","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-03-07T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":7},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/247/617768.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/247/617768.jpg"},"summary":"<p>While navigating their latest crisis, Sae Royi and Yi Seo come across a potential investor. Hyun Yi preps for the competition's final round. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796788"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796789,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796789/itaewon-class-1x13-episode-13","name":"Episode 13","season":1,"number":13,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-03-13","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-03-13T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":7.3},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/247/617769.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/247/617769.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Geun Soo moves closer to his goal. With their sights set high, Sae Royi and his team take the business to the next level. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796789"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796790,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796790/itaewon-class-1x14-episode-14","name":"Episode 14","season":1,"number":14,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-03-14","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-03-14T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":6.3},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/247/617770.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/247/617770.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Yi Seo overworks herself as she steps into a critical role for the team's new strategy against Jang Ga, worrying Sae Ro Yi. </p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796790"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796791,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796791/itaewon-class-1x15-episode-15","name":"Episode 15","season":1,"number":15,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-03-20","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-03-20T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":7.3},"image":null,"summary":"<p>Searching for Yi Seo, Seung Kwon pays his old boss a visit. Dae Hee receives a warning from Soo Ah, and a disturbing call from Geun Won.</p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796791"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}},{"id":1796792,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796792/itaewon-class-1x16-episode-16","name":"Episode 16","season":1,"number":16,"type":"regular","airdate":"2020-03-21","airtime":"22:50","airstamp":"2020-03-21T13:50:00+00:00","runtime":80,"rating":{"average":8.3},"image":null,"summary":"<p>Yi Seo runs from Geun Won, who's out to put an end to everything. Desperate to salvage his crumbling legacy, Dae Hee heads to Dan Bam.</p>","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1796792"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/45540","name":"Itaewon Class"}}}],"cast":[{"person":{"id":84309,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/people/84309/park-seo-jun","name":"Park Seo Jun","country":{"name":"Korea, Republic of","code":"KR","timezone":"Asia/Seoul"},"birthday":"1988-12-16","deathday":null,"gender":"Male","image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/19/48356.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/19/48356.jpg"},"updated":1766984009,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/people/84309"}}},"character":{"id":684970,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/characters/684970/itaewon-class-park-sae-royi","name":"Park Sae Royi","image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/235/588165.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/235/588165.jpg"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/characters/684970"}}},"self":false,"voice":fa